<%- include('_partials/head', { pageStyles: ['/css/site-authority.css?v=1','/css/kurukoo-public-pages.css?v=3','/css/kurukoo-home.css?v=3.0.1'] }) %>
<% const publicAds = typeof homepageAds !== 'undefined' && Array.isArray(homepageAds) ? homepageAds : []; %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>
<main class="home-page">
  <section class="home-hero section"><div class="container home-hero__grid"><div class="home-hero__copy"><span class="eyebrow">Your everyday, sorted.</span><h1>Tell Kurukoo<br><span class="home-hero__accent">what you need</span></h1><p class="home-hero__lead"><strong>One place to organise what matters.</strong><br>Kurukoo helps make sense of what you need, keeps the context together and gives you a clear place to review requests, tasks, discovery and the next useful step.</p><div class="home-hero__actions"><a class="btn btn-primary home-hero__cta" href="/login">Try Kurukoo free</a><a class="btn btn-outline home-cta" href="/how-it-works">See how it works</a></div><div class="home-hero__principles" aria-label="Kurukoo principles"><span><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#chat"></use></svg><strong>Conversational first</strong><small>Natural dialogue that understands your intent.</small></span><span><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#discover"></use></svg><strong>Connected context</strong><small>Useful next steps stay tied to the request.</small></span><span><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#safety"></use></svg><strong>Private by design</strong><small>Your conversations and context stay with you.</small></span></div></div><div class="home-chat-card" aria-label="Illustrative Kurukoo conversation"><div class="home-chat-card__top"><%- include('_partials/brand-mark') %><div><strong>Kurukoo</strong><small>Your conversational assistant</small></div><span class="home-online">●</span></div><div class="home-chat-card__body"><div class="chat-bubble chat-bubble--user">I need to get a generator delivered tomorrow.</div><div class="chat-bubble chat-bubble--assistant">I can help capture the request, check supported options and show you what needs confirmation.</div><div class="chat-result"><div><span class="result-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#request"></use></svg></span><div><strong>Useful sources</strong><small>Connected context, ready to review</small></div></div><div class="home-chat-card__source-list"><span><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#document"></use></svg>Project brief</span><span><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#list"></use></svg>Risk register</span><span><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#note"></use></svg>Decisions log</span><span><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#document"></use></svg>Draft agenda</span></div></div></div><div class="home-chat-card__composer"><span>Ask Kurukoo anything...</span><button type="button" aria-label="Illustrative send"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#arrow-up"></use></svg></button></div><div class="home-chat-card__footer">The conversation stays connected to your request.<a class="text-link home-chat-card__flow-link" href="/how-it-works">See the flow <span>→</span></a></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-process-strip" aria-label="How Kurukoo helps"><div class="container"><div><span>01</span><strong>Start with a need</strong><small>Say what you want in your own words.</small></div><div><span>02</span><strong>Kurukoo organises it</strong><small>Requirements and next steps stay visible.</small></div><div><span>03</span><strong>See the useful step</strong><small>Only known states are shown as known.</small></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-role-paths section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading section-heading--left"><span class="eyebrow">One conversation, every role.</span><h2>Useful whether you need help, offer it, or grow around it.</h2><p>Kurukoo brings different pathways into one conversational surface instead of sending people to disconnected dashboards.</p></div><div class="home-role-paths__grid"><a class="home-role-path" href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20a%20service"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#request"></use></svg></span><strong>Request a service</strong><p>Start with a need, repair, delivery, food, worker, or another everyday request.</p><b>Ask for help <i>→</i></b></a><a class="home-role-path" href="/chat?prompt=I%20want%20to%20offer%20my%20skills"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#work"></use></svg></span><strong>Offer your skills</strong><p>Describe what you do and keep your provider or business journey connected to the same Chat.</p><b>Offer a skill <i>→</i></b></a><a class="home-role-path" href="/advertise"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#package"></use></svg></span><strong>Grow your business</strong><p>Explore disclosed ways to make products and services discoverable without claiming guaranteed demand.</p><b>Review business options <i>→</i></b></a></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-storefront section" aria-labelledby="storefront-demo-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Agentic Storefront · demo</span><h2 id="storefront-demo-title">See a request become a clear next step.</h2><p>This interactive preview illustrates Kurukoo’s canonical request flow. It does not show a live provider, inventory, price or payment state.</p></div>
      <div class="storefront-demo" data-storefront-demo>
        <div class="storefront-demo__controls" role="group" aria-label="Choose a request example">
          <button type="button" class="is-active" data-storefront-scenario="food">Find food</button>
          <button type="button" data-storefront-scenario="repair">Arrange a repair</button>
          <button type="button" data-storefront-scenario="ride">Plan a ride</button>
        </div>
        <div class="storefront-demo__grid">
          <article class="storefront-demo__conversation">
            <div class="storefront-demo__bar"><%- include('_partials/brand-mark') %><strong>Kurukoo request preview</strong><span>Demo</span></div>
            <div class="storefront-demo__messages"><p class="demo-message demo-message--user" data-demo-user>Help me find dinner nearby.</p><p class="demo-message demo-message--assistant" data-demo-assistant>I’ll capture what you need, then show an option only when availability and pricing are confirmed.</p></div>
            <div class="storefront-demo__offer"><span class="workspace-eyebrow" data-demo-category>Food &amp; drink</span><h3 data-demo-title>Request details first</h3><p data-demo-detail>Choose what you want and where you need it. No provider is selected yet.</p><div class="storefront-demo__offer-row"><strong data-demo-price>Price on request</strong><span data-demo-state>Awaiting details</span></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-demo-action>Continue in chat</button></div>
          </article>
          <div class="storefront-demo__explain">
            <div><span class="workspace-eyebrow">Execution teardown</span><h3>One request, visible boundaries.</h3></div>
            <ol class="execution-steps"><li><strong>Capture</strong><span>Conversation collects the request details.</span></li><li><strong>Coordinate</strong><span>Eligible options are considered against real availability.</span></li><li><strong>Confirm</strong><span>A quote or next step is shown only when its state is known.</span></li><li><strong>Fulfil</strong><span>Any coordination follows the same Economic Request lifecycle.</span></li></ol>
            <a href="/how-it-works" class="text-link">How request states work →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="storefront-comparison" aria-label="Kurukoo storefront truthfulness comparison"><div><span>Surface</span><strong>What it can show</strong></div><div><span>Discovery</span><strong>Useful context, not a live-stock claim</strong></div><div><span>Quote</span><strong>Awaiting confirmation until a provider confirms</strong></div><div><span>Payment</span><strong>Verified only after a configured payment adapter confirms it</strong></div><div><span>Escrow ledger</span><strong>Internal ledger state, not a claim that funds are held</strong></div></div>
      <div class="home-pulse-ticker" aria-label="Example request lifecycle states"><span>Live pulse · illustrative states</span><div><b>Request captured</b><i>→</i><b>Availability checked</b><i>→</i><b>Quote awaiting confirmation</b><i>→</i><b>Fulfilment when confirmed</b></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-living section"><div class="container"><div class="home-living__layout"><div class="home-living__visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="home-memory-orbit home-memory-orbit--outer"></div><div class="home-memory-orbit home-memory-orbit--inner"></div><div class="home-memory-core"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#saved"></use></svg><small>Living memory</small></div><span class="home-memory-node home-memory-node--one">preferences</span><span class="home-memory-node home-memory-node--two">locations</span><span class="home-memory-node home-memory-node--three">your control</span></div><div><div class="section-heading section-heading--left"><span class="eyebrow">A helper that learns carefully</span><h2>Living memory, useful context, under your control.</h2><p>When you choose to keep information connected to your profile, Kurukoo can use it to make future conversations more useful.</p></div><div class="home-feature-list"><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#saved"></use></svg></span><div><h3>Preferences</h3><p>Keep useful choices and habits connected to your Kurukoo relationship.</p></div></article><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#discover"></use></svg></span><div><h3>Locations</h3><p>Save places you choose to use for future requests and reminders.</p></div></article><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#settings"></use></svg></span><div><h3>Your control</h3><p>Edit, forget or disable personalisation from your Memory and Settings areas.</p></div></article></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-roles section"><div class="container"><div class="home-roles__layout"><div><div class="section-heading section-heading--left"><span class="eyebrow">One relationship with Kurukoo</span><h2>Ask, organise, coordinate or discover.</h2><p>Kurukoo is not a collection of separate apps. The same conversation can move between everyday help, requests, reminders, discovery and network coordination.</p></div><div class="network-preview-grid"><div class="network-mini-card"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#chat"></use></svg></span><strong>Ask Kurukoo</strong><p>Describe what you need in your own words and let Kurukoo work out the useful next step.</p><a href="/chat" class="text-link">Start chatting →</a></div><div class="network-mini-card"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#reminder"></use></svg></span><strong>Keep life moving</strong><p>Create reminders, follow up on requests and return to conversations without starting over.</p><a href="/reminders" class="text-link">See reminders →</a></div><div class="network-mini-card"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#channels"></use></svg></span><strong>Use the network</strong><p>When a request needs someone else, Kurukoo can work with eligible providers, businesses, agents and other participants.</p><a href="/network" class="text-link">Explore the network →</a></div></div></div><aside class="home-daily-picks" aria-label="Daily Picks"><div class="home-daily-picks__heading"><span class="eyebrow">Daily picks</span><a href="/daily-picks" class="text-link">See all <span>→</span></a></div><div class="home-daily-picks__rail"><% publicAds.filter(ad => ['public_home','public_business'].includes(String(ad.placement || ''))).slice(0,3).forEach(ad => { %><a class="home-pick-card" href="<%= ad.clickUrl || ad.destination || '/advertise' %>"><span class="sponsored-badge"><%= ad.disclosure || 'Kurukoo promotion' %></span><img alt="Kurukoo image" src="<%= ad.imageUrl %>" alt="<%= ad.title %>"><strong><%= ad.title %></strong><small><%= ad.desc %></small></a><% }) %></div><% if (!publicAds.length) { %><p class="home-ad-empty">Daily Picks will appear here when an approved campaign is active.</p><% } %></aside></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-pulse section"><div class="container home-split"><div class="section-heading section-heading--left"><span class="eyebrow">Discover</span><h2>Find useful things around you.</h2><p>When location context is relevant and available, Kurukoo can help you explore services, opportunities, events and other useful activity without pretending that a provider is live or verified when it is not.</p><div class="home-hero__actions"><a href="/discover" class="btn btn-outline">Open Discover</a></div></div><div class="channel-list"><div class="channel-item"><div class="channel-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#discover"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Nearby services</h3><p>Explore eligible local capabilities when reliable location and availability data exists.</p></div></div><div class="channel-item"><div class="channel-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#channels"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Events &amp; opportunities</h3><p>Discover useful activity without turning the network into a conventional directory.</p></div></div><div class="channel-item"><div class="channel-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#safety"></use></svg></div><div><h3>Safety &amp; urgent help</h3><p>Get guidance and coordination support while keeping emergency-service boundaries clear.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-explore section"><div class="container"><div class="home-explore__heading"><div class="section-heading section-heading--left"><span class="eyebrow">What can you ask?</span><h2>Start with the need, not a category.</h2><p>These are examples, not separate transaction engines. Kurukoo uses the same conversation and request model underneath.</p></div><% const exploreAd = publicAds.find(ad => String(ad.placement || '') === 'public_business'); %><% if (exploreAd) { %><a class="home-managed-ad home-managed-ad--dark" href="<%= exploreAd.clickUrl || exploreAd.destination || '/advertise' %>"><span class="sponsored-badge"><%= exploreAd.disclosure || 'Sponsored' %></span><strong><%= exploreAd.title %></strong><small><%= exploreAd.desc %></small><b><%= exploreAd.ctaText || 'Learn more' %> <i>→</i></b></a><% } %></div><div class="capability-grid"><a href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20food" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#package"></use></svg></span><strong>Food &amp; groceries</strong></a><a href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20to%20get%20somewhere" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#ride"></use></svg></span><strong>Getting somewhere</strong></a><a href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20a%20repair" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#settings"></use></svg></span><strong>Repairs</strong></a><a href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20something%20delivered" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#package"></use></svg></span><strong>Delivery</strong></a><a href="/chat?prompt=Help%20me%20find%20work" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#work"></use></svg></span><strong>Work &amp; tasks</strong></a><a href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20professional%20help" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#help"></use></svg></span><strong>Professional help</strong></a><a href="/chat?prompt=Remind%20me%20about%20something" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#reminder"></use></svg></span><strong>Reminders</strong></a><a href="/chat?prompt=I%20need%20urgent%20safety%20help" class="capability-card"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#safety"></use></svg></span><strong>Safety support</strong></a></div><div class="center-cta"><a href="/explore" class="btn btn-outline">Explore what you can ask</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-day section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">An illustrative day with Kurukoo</span><h2>From morning move to evening chop.</h2><p>One conversation can help coordinate the day without asking you to juggle apps or tabs.</p></div><% const dayAd = publicAds.find(ad => String(ad.placement || '') === 'public_diaspora') || publicAds.find(ad => String(ad.placement || '') === 'public_business'); %><% if (dayAd) { %><a class="home-managed-ad home-managed-ad--terracotta" href="<%= dayAd.clickUrl || dayAd.destination || '/advertise' %>"><span class="sponsored-badge"><%= dayAd.disclosure || 'Sponsored' %></span><strong><%= dayAd.title %></strong><small><%= dayAd.desc %></small><b><%= dayAd.ctaText || 'Learn more' %> <i>→</i></b></a><% } %><div class="day-timeline"><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#reminder"></use></svg></span><small>06:30</small><h3>Wake up</h3><p>“Need a lift this morning? Tell me where you are heading.”</p></article><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#package"></use></svg></span><small>12:00</small><h3>Lunch break</h3><p>“Looking for lunch? Tell me what you would like to order.”</p></article><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#settings"></use></svg></span><small>14:00</small><h3>Get it fixed</h3><p>“Describe the repair and your area. I can help start the search.”</p></article><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#points"></use></svg></span><small>16:00</small><h3>Hustle time</h3><p>“Want to offer a skill? Tell me what work you do.”</p></article><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#package"></use></svg></span><small>18:00</small><h3>Send it</h3><p>“Share the pickup and delivery areas to coordinate a parcel.”</p></article><article><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="k-icon"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#reminder"></use></svg></span><small>21:00</small><h3>Wind down</h3><p>“Set up tomorrow’s request whenever you are ready.”</p></article></div><div class="home-bottom-cta"><a href="/chat" class="text-link">Start your day with Kurukoo →</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-channel-strip section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Channels</span><h2>One Kurukoo relationship, different access points.</h2><p>Web Chat is active in this deployment. WhatsApp, Telegram, SMS and USSD are represented for the future but are not presented as connected until their adapters are configured.</p></div><div class="home-channel-strip__grid"><a href="/chat" class="home-channel-strip__item home-channel-strip__item--active"><span>W</span><strong>Web Chat</strong><small>Available now</small></a><a href="/channels" class="home-channel-strip__item home-channel-strip__item--unavailable channel-item--unavailable"><span>WA</span><strong>WhatsApp</strong><small>Not connected</small></a><a href="/channels" class="home-channel-strip__item home-channel-strip__item--unavailable channel-item--unavailable"><span>TG</span><strong>Telegram</strong><small>Not connected</small></a><a href="/channels" class="home-channel-strip__item home-channel-strip__item--unavailable channel-item--unavailable"><span>US</span><strong>USSD / SMS</strong><small>Not connected</small></a></div><div class="home-bottom-cta"><a href="/channels" class="btn btn-outline">See channels</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-final section"><div class="container home-final__inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Ready when you are</span><h2>Make your next step clearer.</h2><p>Start with a free Kurukoo workspace, then use Agent, Requests, Tasks and Discover in the way that fits the work.</p></div><div class="home-final__editorial">One calm place for the things that move through your day.</div><a href="/login" class="btn btn-light home-cta">Try Kurukoo free</a></div></section>
</main>
<script src="/js/kurukoo-home.js?v=2" defer></script>
<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
